1
00:01:13,439 --> 00:01:14,519
Miss, where's my bag?

2
00:01:14,879 --> 00:01:15,719
I didn't notice.

3
00:01:15,920 --> 00:01:16,920
I left it right here.

4
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:56,879
The next morning,

5
00:02:57,319 --> 00:02:58,319
I went to the scene.

6
00:02:59,439 --> 00:03:01,039
I took a photo of this under the bench.

7
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:04,039
This glove has "Sheng" stitched on it.

8
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,719
Your mother knitted this for you, right?

9
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:10,560
So what if she did?

10
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,280
I want to know

11
00:03:15,599 --> 00:03:16,560
why on that night,

12
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:18,919
you two didn't go home together.

13
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:21,599
What does that have to do with you?

14
00:03:22,159 --> 00:03:22,800
She was her,

15
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:23,639
and I was me.

16
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,400
Why did we have to go home together?

17
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,199
If you'd gone home together,

18
00:03:27,719 --> 00:03:28,840
she wouldn't have frozen to death.

19
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:33,120
I know that

20
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,120
as a Beer Taster,

21
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:35,000
she never drank.

22
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:37,400
So why did she drink so much that night?

23
00:03:37,719 --> 00:03:38,680
Who was she drinking with?

24
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,280
I want to find out the truth.

25
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,039
The truth?

26
00:03:44,879 --> 00:03:46,080
Didn't you ask me here

27
00:03:46,199 --> 00:03:47,240
to tell me the truth?

28
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:48,840
What truth would I tell you?

29
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,560
Didn't you ask me here?

30
00:03:52,599 --> 00:03:53,879
Didn't you write this note to me?

31
00:04:00,719 --> 00:04:01,639
That's not my handwriting.

32
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:04,639
Something's wrong.

33
00:04:04,639 --> 00:04:05,120
Let's get out of here.

34
00:04:06,759 --> 00:04:07,599
Nobody move!

35
00:04:11,039 --> 00:04:12,280
I called you both here today

36
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:14,439
to find out the truth.

37
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,120
If we don't figure it out,

38
00:04:16,759 --> 00:04:18,199
neither of you is leaving here alive!

39
00:04:25,079 --> 00:04:25,800
Liu Xiaosheng,

40
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:27,759
how the hell did your mom die?

41
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:29,519
You were right there at the time.

42
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:31,040
How could she still freeze to death?

43
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:32,959
What do you know?

44
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:34,759
You didn't know her at all!

45
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:37,120
I didn't know her?

46
00:04:38,199 --> 00:04:39,040
Your mom and my master

47
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,399
were the best people in the world.

48
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:41,959
How could I not know her?

49
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:44,319
You knew her?

50
00:04:44,839 --> 00:04:45,800
Ever heard of Chen Yuan?

51
00:04:46,319 --> 00:04:47,000
Chen Yuan?

52
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,639
Who's Chen Yuan?

53
00:04:50,839 --> 00:04:52,079
You don't even know Chen Yuan,

54
00:04:52,439 --> 00:04:53,839
yet you think you knew her?

55
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:55,959
Chen Yuan was a teacher.

56
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:57,959
Every vacation, he'd come tutor me.

57
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,920
He said he was tutoring me,

58
00:05:00,439 --> 00:05:01,800
but he was really after my mom.

59
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,040
Stop talking!

60
00:05:06,399 --> 00:05:07,160
Stay out of this!

61
00:05:07,759 --> 00:05:09,000
I've never told this to anyone.

62
00:05:09,399 --> 00:05:10,720
I planned to take it to my grave.

63
00:05:11,399 --> 00:05:12,720
Since things have come to this,

64
00:05:13,160 --> 00:05:14,800
and who knows if I'll live past today,

65
00:05:15,279 --> 00:05:16,519
I don't care anymore.

66
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,279
Tell me the truth, kid!

67
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:21,319
What really happened with Chen Yuan?

68
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:23,000
Did he hurt you two?

69
00:05:23,199 --> 00:05:24,040
It's because of him

70
00:05:24,439 --> 00:05:25,319
that my mom died!

71
00:05:25,759 --> 00:05:26,600
If it weren't for him,

72
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,399
she would never have frozen to death!

73
00:05:32,199 --> 00:05:33,199
Where does Chen live?

74
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,160
I don't know!

75
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:35,160
Speak!

76
00:05:35,519 --> 00:05:36,360
I don't know!

77
00:05:38,639 --> 00:05:39,680
Tieping, calm down!

78
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,759
I've kept this buried inside for over ten years.

79
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:43,319
I kept quiet

80
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:44,920
not for Chen Yuan's sake,

81
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:47,360
but so people wouldn't badmouth my mom!

82
00:05:48,319 --> 00:05:49,360
She's already dead!

83
00:05:49,879 --> 00:05:50,959
She can't speak for herself!

84
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:53,040
You all came demanding the truth from me!

85
00:05:53,759 --> 00:05:54,399
Fine!

86
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:56,519
I'll tell you what the truth is!

87
00:05:58,240 --> 00:05:59,439
Write carefully now.

88
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:04,040
What's the line after "Plunging three thousand feet"?

89
00:06:06,879 --> 00:06:07,519
I don't know.

90
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:08,800
You don't know?

91
00:06:09,279 --> 00:06:10,600
Didn't we just recite it?

92
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:12,160
How did you forget already?

93
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:15,279
Thank you for your hard work, Mr. Chen.

94
00:06:15,519 --> 00:06:16,639
You've been talking all morning.

95
00:06:16,759 --> 00:06:17,519
Have some fruit.

96
00:06:18,519 --> 00:06:20,199
Good job to you too, Xiaosheng.

97
00:06:20,399 --> 00:06:21,160
You should have some fruit too.

98
00:06:21,759 --> 00:06:22,759
Thank you, Sister Xuemei.

99
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,160
You're welcome.

100
00:06:33,759 --> 00:06:34,439
Let me see.

101
00:06:34,439 --> 00:06:35,519
What did you write?

102
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,519
Xiaosheng wrote all of this.

103
00:06:39,199 --> 00:06:40,120
Yeah.

104
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,759
He's been writing all morning.

105
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:43,399
Really put his heart into it.

106
00:06:44,639 --> 00:06:45,360
Great job.

107
00:06:45,839 --> 00:06:46,879
I'm making dumplings today,

108
00:06:47,079 --> 00:06:48,240
a nice treat for both of you.

109
00:06:48,639 --> 00:06:49,639
Dumplings are my favorite!

110
00:06:53,639 --> 00:06:55,160
Why did you lie to my mom?

111
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:56,879
If I told the truth,

112
00:06:56,879 --> 00:06:57,639
wouldn't she chew you out?

113
00:06:58,399 --> 00:06:59,519
Mind your own business.

114
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:00,560
You...

115
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:05,879
That dress...

116
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:06,879
You bought it.

117
00:07:08,079 --> 00:07:09,600
She wears it every time you come over,

118
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,000
acting all vain.

119
00:07:11,519 --> 00:07:12,600
What do you mean, "vain"?

120
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:13,680
She looks pretty.

121
00:07:13,879 --> 00:07:15,160
If she looks pretty, she deserves compliments.

122
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,879
You don't need to buy her clothes anymore.

123
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:17,720
I will.

124
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,279
How old are you anyway?

125
00:07:19,839 --> 00:07:20,600
Where'll you get the money?

126
00:07:20,879 --> 00:07:22,040
Someday I'll make money.

127
00:07:22,519 --> 00:07:24,160
And I'll buy her the best clothes.

128
00:07:24,879 --> 00:07:25,639
That's the spirit.

129
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,839
I never even thought about

130
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,360
buying clothes for my mom.

131
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:32,199
Too bad she's gone now.

132
00:07:41,199 --> 00:07:41,839
And another thing.

133
00:07:42,759 --> 00:07:44,079
Don't draw my mom anymore.

134
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:46,639
I don't like her on bottle caps,

135
00:07:46,839 --> 00:07:47,519
scattered all over the ground.

136
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:48,279
All right.

137
00:07:49,439 --> 00:07:50,920
Then this is a one-of-a-kind.

138
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:52,040
What's a one-of-a-kind?

139
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,519
A one-of-a-kind?

140
00:07:53,759 --> 00:07:55,839
It means there'll never be another one.

141
00:07:57,519 --> 00:07:58,600
You'll understand when you're older.

142
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:21,399
Mom.

143
00:08:25,759 --> 00:08:26,279
Mom?

144
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:27,040
Mom!

145
00:08:28,639 --> 00:08:29,040
Mom...

146
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:30,199
You've been drinking?

147
00:08:30,519 --> 00:08:31,759
How did you get so drunk?

148
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,879
I thought you couldn't drink.

149
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:35,840
Who got you this wasted?

150
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:37,000
Xiaosheng.

151
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:38,799
It's so cold out.

152
00:08:38,919 --> 00:08:39,799
Why did you come out?

153
00:08:40,159 --> 00:08:41,120
Hurry on home.

154
00:08:42,759 --> 00:08:44,039
You left your pager at home.

155
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,360
It kept going off.

156
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:46,639
A lot of people are looking for you.

157
00:08:46,679 --> 00:08:48,039
I know what it's about.

158
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,679
You didn't have to come all this way.

159
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:50,720
Hurry back home.

160
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:51,360
It's too cold out.

161
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:54,320
Then what are you doing here?

162
00:08:56,519 --> 00:08:57,440
I'm making a call.

163
00:08:57,759 --> 00:08:59,519
You're calling Chen Yuan again?

164
00:09:03,399 --> 00:09:04,639
Xiaosheng...

165
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:07,200
Isn't it almost New Year's?

166
00:09:07,639 --> 00:09:09,519
I made plans with Mr. Chen

167
00:09:09,559 --> 00:09:10,399
to ring in the new year together,

168
00:09:10,639 --> 00:09:11,639
and count down together.

169
00:09:11,799 --> 00:09:15,120
Five, four, three, two, one...

170
00:09:15,159 --> 00:09:16,279
Happy New Year!

171
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:19,679
Happy New Year, Xiaosheng.

172
00:09:20,759 --> 00:09:21,960
Come on.

173
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:24,200
Don't be mad.

174
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:25,759
It's such a happy occasion.

175
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:27,559
I've made up my mind.

176
00:09:27,799 --> 00:09:30,919
We'll live with Uncle Chen from now on.

177
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:33,639
The three of us can build a good life.

178
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:34,639
Okay?

179
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:36,080
No!

180
00:09:37,039 --> 00:09:38,279
If you want to live with him, do it yourself!

181
00:09:38,559 --> 00:09:39,559
I'm not living with him!

182
00:09:41,679 --> 00:09:42,799
My sweet boy...

183
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:45,159
You're my one and only baby.

184
00:09:46,399 --> 00:09:48,080
You'll understand when you grow up.

185
00:09:49,919 --> 00:09:50,679
In this life,

186
00:09:50,799 --> 00:09:52,279
everyone needs a home.

187
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:53,879
Someone to help you,

188
00:09:54,639 --> 00:09:56,320
someone to have your back and cheer you on.

189
00:09:56,799 --> 00:09:58,559
I can have your back and cheer you on!

190
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,120
We don't need him!

191
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:16,159
Our Xiaosheng has really grown up.

192
00:10:16,559 --> 00:10:17,960
You can protect Mom now.

193
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:19,320
Mom's so happy.

194
00:10:21,519 --> 00:10:23,000
But Mom also wants to give Xiaosheng

195
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:24,360
a complete home.

196
00:10:25,799 --> 00:10:27,279
A real, proper home.

197
00:10:27,879 --> 00:10:29,679
Then no one can ever bully us again.

198
00:10:36,039 --> 00:10:37,159
Look how cold my boy is.

199
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:39,320
Your little hands are freezing.

200
00:10:40,879 --> 00:10:41,200
Quick.

201
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:42,240
Put on your mittens.

202
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:46,759
Mom just knitted these mittens for you.

203
00:10:46,759 --> 00:10:48,080
Your name is on them.

204
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:48,919
"Sheng."

205
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:49,960
Do you like them?

206
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:51,320
Come on, hurry up.

207
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:52,000
Here.

208
00:10:52,919 --> 00:10:53,919
Don't catch a cold.

209
00:10:53,919 --> 00:10:55,080
Put them on, be a good boy.

210
00:10:55,639 --> 00:10:56,559
Be good, Xiaosheng.

211
00:10:59,679 --> 00:11:00,440
Hurry and put them on.

212
00:11:00,759 --> 00:11:01,440
Head home first.

213
00:11:01,679 --> 00:11:03,399
Mom will be home right after this call.

214
00:11:03,759 --> 00:11:04,399
Hurry home now.

215
00:11:04,639 --> 00:11:05,320
Mom...

216
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:06,399
Go on, head home.

217
00:11:07,879 --> 00:11:09,120
Hello, Yuan?

218
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:14,799
Sorry, you have the wrong number.

219
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:15,919
This is a payphone.

220
00:11:45,759 --> 00:11:46,399
Hello.

221
00:11:46,399 --> 00:11:47,200
I'm looking for Chen Yuan.

222
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:53,840
Let me leave a phone number then.

223
00:11:54,759 --> 00:11:55,759
0410.

224
00:11:56,519 --> 00:11:58,240
7801495.

225
00:11:59,240 --> 00:11:59,799
Thank you.

226
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:12,080
I was furious that night.

227
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:14,039
Thinking about how, just to see Chen Yuan,

228
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:15,799
she was in such a rush to kick me out.

229
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:18,759
What a loose woman.

230
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:24,440
That's your mother!

231
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:26,519
Badmouth her again, I dare you!

232
00:12:26,759 --> 00:12:27,279
Tieping!

233
00:12:27,399 --> 00:12:28,159
Calm down!

234
00:12:30,399 --> 00:12:31,200
And you!

235
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:33,120
You're no good either!

236
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:35,759
Where's the money Sister Xuemei got from Ma Guowen?

237
00:12:36,519 --> 00:12:37,159
Where is it?

238
00:12:38,159 --> 00:12:39,200
What money?

239
00:12:39,559 --> 00:12:40,240
The money!

240
00:12:41,679 --> 00:12:42,360
Playing dumb, huh?

241
00:12:47,759 --> 00:12:48,519
What's this?

242
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:50,000
Liu Xuemei's bag!

243
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:50,639
My mom's bag?

244
00:12:51,639 --> 00:12:52,600
Why do you have it?

245
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:53,879
That's right.

246
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,279
This is my mom's bag.

247
00:12:55,759 --> 00:12:56,799
There's a buttonhole here.

248
00:12:57,039 --> 00:12:58,399
She sewed a teddy bear over it.

249
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:00,320
If I hadn't bumped into your mom

250
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,759
carrying this bag to the market,

251
00:13:02,159 --> 00:13:03,840
I wouldn't have guessed you stole the money!

252
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:05,039
My mom?

253
00:13:05,879 --> 00:13:07,639
How... How could the bag be with my mom?

254
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:09,879
What money? What money are you talking about?

255
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:11,000
No, no, no... I—

256
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:11,799
"I didn't!" Still trying to deny it?

257
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:12,879
You liar!

258
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:13,960
I used to think

259
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:15,519
Ma Guowen was the vile one,

260
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:18,360
never thought you'd be one too!

261
00:13:18,639 --> 00:13:19,759
Turns out you're his accomplice!

262
00:13:21,080 --> 00:13:21,720
Tieping!

263
00:13:22,039 --> 00:13:23,279
Tieping, there's a misunderstanding here!

264
00:13:23,639 --> 00:13:24,360
I— Shut up!

265
00:13:25,159 --> 00:13:25,919
All these years,

266
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:27,960
Sister Xuemei was falsely accused every single day,

267
00:13:28,519 --> 00:13:29,639
cursed out by name!

268
00:13:30,159 --> 00:13:31,559
Turns out you took the money,

269
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:33,080
No!

270
00:13:33,279 --> 00:13:35,559
leaving her to live in disgrace for over a decade!

271
00:13:35,559 --> 00:13:36,519
I really have no idea what you're talking about!

272
00:13:36,519 --> 00:13:37,799
You were out living carefree,

273
00:13:38,519 --> 00:13:39,759
and came back acting like a good person!

274
00:13:42,080 --> 00:13:44,039
You're cut from the same cloth as Ma Guowen!

275
00:13:44,159 --> 00:13:45,360
I really didn't take that money!

276
00:13:45,559 --> 00:13:46,159
You deserve to die!

277
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:47,600
Xiaosheng!

278
00:13:47,799 --> 00:13:48,399
Run!

279
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:49,559
Run!

280
00:14:08,639 --> 00:14:09,320
Stop!

281
00:14:13,879 --> 00:14:14,600
Xiaosheng!

282
00:14:24,399 --> 00:14:24,799
Hello?

283
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:25,720
I want to report a crime.

284
00:15:15,519 --> 00:15:16,120
Tieping.

285
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:19,399
Why couldn't you just listen to your master?

286
00:15:39,519 --> 00:15:40,200
Holy shit!

287
00:15:41,679 --> 00:15:42,879
What the hell are you doing?

288
00:15:43,799 --> 00:15:45,039
You scared the hell out of me!

289
00:15:45,159 --> 00:15:46,320
Cheng Youtian, what are you doing?

290
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:49,440
Haven't seen you in years.

291
00:15:50,759 --> 00:15:51,240
Look at you...

292
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:52,159
It's freezing today.

293
00:15:52,159 --> 00:15:53,360
Coming in the dead of night like this...

294
00:15:53,559 --> 00:15:54,639
Couldn't you have called?

295
00:15:54,639 --> 00:15:55,840
Did you really have to come in person?

296
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:56,440
In this freezing cold?

297
00:15:56,519 --> 00:15:56,960
What is it?

298
00:15:57,159 --> 00:15:58,360
I figured you wouldn't pick up.

299
00:16:00,039 --> 00:16:00,960
Well, go ahead then.

300
00:16:01,159 --> 00:16:01,840
What's so important...

301
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:02,559
...that you had to say it to my face?

302
00:16:02,600 --> 00:16:03,039
Speak up.

303
00:16:03,639 --> 00:16:04,320
What's the matter?

304
00:16:05,039 --> 00:16:05,879
I heard...

305
00:16:06,799 --> 00:16:07,840
...you're selling the factory again?

306
00:16:09,799 --> 00:16:10,639
Cheng Youtian.

307
00:16:11,039 --> 00:16:12,919
Whether I sell it or not, what's it to you?

308
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:15,759
Once the factory isn't yours anymore,

309
00:16:16,559 --> 00:16:17,960
what you owe everyone...

310
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:20,360
can that finally be settled?

311
00:16:21,279 --> 00:16:22,720
Did I hear that right?

312
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:25,159
What do I have unsettled with anyone?

313
00:16:25,759 --> 00:16:26,559
Name names.

314
00:16:26,960 --> 00:16:27,360
Who?

315
00:16:27,440 --> 00:16:28,320
Who is "everyone"?

316
00:16:29,679 --> 00:16:32,159
The money everyone pooled to buy the factory back then.

317
00:16:32,559 --> 00:16:33,559
Some folks...

318
00:16:33,840 --> 00:16:34,960
...feared your retaliation...

319
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:36,399
...so they didn't dare take it back.

320
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:38,279
When they came to you later,

321
00:16:38,519 --> 00:16:39,519
you never resolved it either.

322
00:16:40,120 --> 00:16:41,200
Now that the factory is being sold,

323
00:16:42,399 --> 00:16:43,759
I'm here on behalf of everyone...

324
00:16:45,159 --> 00:16:46,240
...to talk sense into you.

325
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:50,080
You have the nerve to bring up the past?

326
00:16:51,039 --> 00:16:51,720
What about it?

327
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:52,200
Back then,

328
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:53,799
you all teamed up to go against me.

329
00:16:53,799 --> 00:16:54,639
You couldn't beat me.

330
00:16:54,840 --> 00:16:56,039
Now that life's been rough,

331
00:16:56,879 --> 00:16:57,720
you want to shake me down?

332
00:16:59,279 --> 00:17:00,360
How much are you trying to extort?

333
00:17:00,399 --> 00:17:00,960
Speak.

334
00:17:01,759 --> 00:17:02,600
Ma Guowen.

335
00:17:04,079 --> 00:17:05,279
Ask your conscience.

336
00:17:06,039 --> 00:17:07,119
As the factory director,

337
00:17:08,079 --> 00:17:09,440
how have you treated us veterans?

338
00:17:09,799 --> 00:17:10,759
How have you treated the workers?

339
00:17:11,960 --> 00:17:12,720
Once the factory is sold,

340
00:17:13,200 --> 00:17:15,119
you'll instantly become a multimillionaire.

341
00:17:15,680 --> 00:17:17,920
What about those who gave their lives for it?

342
00:17:18,759 --> 00:17:19,759
What do they get?

343
00:17:21,279 --> 00:17:22,279
The reason I came today...

344
00:17:22,599 --> 00:17:23,759
...is to give you a chance.

345
00:17:24,759 --> 00:17:25,799
So people won't...

346
00:17:25,799 --> 00:17:27,640
...spit on your name behind your back.

347
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:31,519
Let them spit!

348
00:17:31,839 --> 00:17:32,960
Whoever wants to spit can go right ahead!

349
00:17:33,279 --> 00:17:33,799
What?

350
00:17:33,839 --> 00:17:34,640
Do you think I, Ma Guowen,

351
00:17:34,640 --> 00:17:36,160
am going to drown in people's spit?

352
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:38,240
Do you people have any conscience?

353
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:41,039
Didn't you get the New Year money I gave you?

354
00:17:41,319 --> 00:17:42,400
250 yuan!

355
00:17:43,119 --> 00:17:45,160
You gave each person 250 yuan for New Year?

356
00:17:45,799 --> 00:17:46,880
You were insulting us!

357
00:17:47,279 --> 00:17:48,440
What, is 250 not money?

358
00:17:48,440 --> 00:17:49,279
Can't you spend it?

359
00:17:49,440 --> 00:17:50,519
What you owe everyone...

360
00:17:50,559 --> 00:17:51,640
...is at least 200,000!

361
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:52,440
Holy crap.

362
00:17:52,519 --> 00:17:53,039
200,000?

363
00:17:53,119 --> 00:17:54,359
Why not say two million?

364
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:55,559
If you really want it,

365
00:17:55,680 --> 00:17:57,400
go ask the dead woman for it.

366
00:17:57,519 --> 00:17:58,079
Liu Xuemei.

367
00:17:58,240 --> 00:17:59,160
I gave the money to her.

368
00:17:59,160 --> 00:17:59,799
Go ask her!

369
00:18:01,079 --> 00:18:01,720
What did you say?

370
00:18:06,839 --> 00:18:07,599
That's impossible.

371
00:18:08,240 --> 00:18:08,880
Don't believe me?

372
00:18:09,839 --> 00:18:11,160
I'll show you the real proof.

373
00:18:20,319 --> 00:18:21,559
Seeing is believing.

374
00:18:22,720 --> 00:18:24,119
I wouldn't show this to just anyone.

375
00:18:36,839 --> 00:18:37,599
Come here, come on.

376
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:38,319
Look at this. Take a look.

377
00:18:39,200 --> 00:18:39,960
See for yourself!

378
00:18:45,440 --> 00:18:46,000
Come on in, come on.

379
00:18:46,160 --> 00:18:46,599
Come on, come on.

380
00:18:46,680 --> 00:18:47,039
Have a seat.

381
00:18:48,680 --> 00:18:49,880
We still have some time

382
00:18:49,880 --> 00:18:50,519
before the auction starts.

383
00:18:50,640 --> 00:18:51,160
Let's have a chat.

384
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:51,680
Come on, come over.

385
00:18:51,759 --> 00:18:52,279
Sit, sit down.

386
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:55,839
Look at today...

387
00:18:56,400 --> 00:18:57,319
Don't just stand there.

388
00:18:57,359 --> 00:18:58,160
Come on, sit down and talk.

389
00:18:59,359 --> 00:19:00,519
On such a great day...

390
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:01,880
Where did you come from?

391
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:05,359
Whatever it is, sit down and tell me.

392
00:19:05,599 --> 00:19:06,960
On such a wonderful day,

393
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:08,200
don't pull such a long face.

394
00:19:08,839 --> 00:19:09,960
Since you're here, let's have a drink.

395
00:19:10,079 --> 00:19:11,200
I've got all kinds of good liquor.

396
00:19:12,319 --> 00:19:12,960
Director Ma.

397
00:19:13,440 --> 00:19:14,160
You know this.

398
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:15,039
I'm a Beer Taster.

399
00:19:15,240 --> 00:19:16,039
I'm not allowed to drink.

400
00:19:16,960 --> 00:19:17,640
Alright, alright.

401
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:18,160
No drinking then.

402
00:19:20,559 --> 00:19:21,920
You came all by yourself.

403
00:19:22,119 --> 00:19:23,240
Leaving your kid at home,

404
00:19:23,559 --> 00:19:24,160
are you...

405
00:19:24,359 --> 00:19:25,079
really not worried?

406
00:19:26,759 --> 00:19:27,720
My son is well-behaved.

407
00:19:27,960 --> 00:19:28,559
He doesn't give me any trouble.

408
00:19:31,519 --> 00:19:33,160
Then I won't beat around the bush.

409
00:19:33,720 --> 00:19:34,960
What are you all really planning?

410
00:19:36,440 --> 00:19:37,319
Just the auction.

411
00:19:37,720 --> 00:19:38,400
Fair competition.

412
00:19:39,839 --> 00:19:40,640
Fair competition.

413
00:19:41,119 --> 00:19:42,400
Then where did your money come from?

414
00:19:43,559 --> 00:19:45,000
Those with money chipped in, those with strength helped out.

415
00:19:45,319 --> 00:19:46,000
We pooled it together.

416
00:19:47,720 --> 00:19:48,440
Oh, boy.

417
00:19:48,440 --> 00:19:49,799
Quite the united front.

418
00:19:50,640 --> 00:19:51,519
Looking at you,

419
00:19:51,960 --> 00:19:53,119
you don't look like the ringleader.

420
00:19:53,799 --> 00:19:54,599
Who sent you?

421
00:19:55,680 --> 00:19:56,359
I volunteered.

422
00:20:01,720 --> 00:20:03,359
That guy Qian sent you, didn't he?

423
00:20:06,759 --> 00:20:07,880
Or was it Cheng Youtian?

424
00:20:08,920 --> 00:20:10,720
Don't tell me it was Chief Engineer Chen?

425
00:20:12,519 --> 00:20:13,960
Don't think I don't know what's going on.

426
00:20:14,200 --> 00:20:15,079
Weren't all of you

427
00:20:15,400 --> 00:20:16,920
down in the workshop basement,

428
00:20:16,920 --> 00:20:18,440
hashing this out together?

429
00:20:18,440 --> 00:20:19,440
Quite the big show you put on.

430
00:20:19,680 --> 00:20:20,440
Even reporters showed up,

431
00:20:20,559 --> 00:20:21,119
didn't they?

432
00:20:21,880 --> 00:20:23,119
Did I leave anyone out?

433
00:20:23,960 --> 00:20:26,119
Little Tu, the cashier, was there too, right?

434
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:29,319
I just don't get it.

435
00:20:29,319 --> 00:20:30,319
All of you people,

436
00:20:30,720 --> 00:20:32,920
why do you insist on crossing me?

437
00:20:34,359 --> 00:20:35,319
If you sell off the factory,

438
00:20:35,640 --> 00:20:36,400
what happens to thousands of workers

439
00:20:36,559 --> 00:20:37,759
and their families?

440
00:20:39,440 --> 00:20:41,839
That's a new business strategy!

441
00:20:42,519 --> 00:20:44,039
You think being a boss is easy?

442
00:20:45,559 --> 00:20:46,720
You have to study national policies,

443
00:20:46,720 --> 00:20:47,240
you know?

444
00:20:47,680 --> 00:20:48,519
Besides, selling the factory,

445
00:20:48,960 --> 00:20:50,559
is that something I can decide all on my own?

446
00:20:51,240 --> 00:20:52,400
If we can't even have a say

447
00:20:52,400 --> 00:20:53,240
in our own livelihoods...

448
00:20:56,920 --> 00:20:57,720
Don't get so worked up.

449
00:20:57,720 --> 00:20:58,559
Don't talk to me about

450
00:20:58,680 --> 00:21:00,359
how you'll run this factory in the future,

451
00:21:00,680 --> 00:21:02,119
or what I'd get by siding with you.

452
00:21:02,119 --> 00:21:02,839
Save your breath.

453
00:21:02,839 --> 00:21:03,799
I don't trust you at all.

454
00:21:04,720 --> 00:21:05,759
Even though I haven't been

455
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:06,759
at our brewery for long,

456
00:21:07,039 --> 00:21:08,279
whether Lapi Brewery has gone sour,

457
00:21:08,279 --> 00:21:09,400
I was the first to taste it.

458
00:21:09,720 --> 00:21:11,599
I don't have the chops to do great things,

459
00:21:11,960 --> 00:21:13,799
but what's rightfully mine, what I want,

460
00:21:13,960 --> 00:21:15,880
what's within my reach,

461
00:21:15,880 --> 00:21:16,640
I have to fight for it.

462
00:21:17,400 --> 00:21:18,200
I have a son.

463
00:21:18,640 --> 00:21:19,799
And I have the rest of my life—

464
00:21:19,799 --> 00:21:21,079
decades ahead of me.

465
00:21:21,799 --> 00:21:22,759
I want to live well,

466
00:21:23,200 --> 00:21:23,880
and live peacefully.

467
00:21:27,079 --> 00:21:27,759
Let's end it here.

468
00:21:28,279 --> 00:21:29,319
The auction is about to start.

469
00:21:30,359 --> 00:21:31,079
Don't go. Don't go.

470
00:21:31,640 --> 00:21:33,039
I prepared something special just for you.

471
00:21:33,799 --> 00:21:34,759
No rush, give it just a minute.

472
00:21:34,839 --> 00:21:35,440
What do you think?

473
00:21:35,720 --> 00:21:36,200
Let go.

474
00:21:36,200 --> 00:21:36,920
Fine, fine, fine.

475
00:21:40,519 --> 00:21:41,200
Well, today,

476
00:21:41,200 --> 00:21:42,880
forget about attending the auction.

477
00:21:42,880 --> 00:21:44,519
I'm not letting you walk out of this room.

478
00:21:49,359 --> 00:21:51,359
You people aren't buying this brewery.

479
00:21:51,359 --> 00:21:52,680
If you're smart,

480
00:21:52,680 --> 00:21:53,960
take the money and walk away.

481
00:21:58,000 --> 00:21:58,680
It's yours.

482
00:22:08,039 --> 00:22:09,240
This is your idea of sincerity.

483
00:22:21,279 --> 00:22:22,799
Holy shit.

484
00:22:24,400 --> 00:22:26,759
You're really asking for a lot.

485
00:22:36,039 --> 00:22:37,359
There's gotta be more than this in the bag.

486
00:22:41,799 --> 00:22:42,720
Quite a lot, actually.

487
00:22:43,079 --> 00:22:44,160
Exactly 200,000.

488
00:22:46,039 --> 00:22:47,039
How much do you want?

489
00:22:47,960 --> 00:22:49,759
How much you get depends on what you can do.

490
00:22:50,599 --> 00:22:51,640
I want all of it.

491
00:22:54,079 --> 00:22:54,920
Holy shit.

492
00:22:59,799 --> 00:23:01,079
Holy shit.

493
00:23:02,680 --> 00:23:04,319
Got quite an appetite, don't you?

494
00:23:09,559 --> 00:23:10,319
Tell you what.

495
00:23:11,240 --> 00:23:12,440
This is some good liquor.

496
00:23:15,720 --> 00:23:16,279
One glass,

497
00:23:16,920 --> 00:23:17,359
10,000.

498
00:23:19,640 --> 00:23:20,359
However much you drink,

499
00:23:20,920 --> 00:23:21,720
is how much you take.

500
00:23:35,519 --> 00:23:36,039
All right.

501
00:23:37,440 --> 00:23:38,440
You said it.

502
00:23:38,680 --> 00:23:39,559
I did.

503
00:24:14,319 --> 00:24:14,920
All right.

504
00:24:28,039 --> 00:24:28,559
Ten thousand.

505
00:24:28,839 --> 00:24:29,599
Again.

506
00:24:57,680 --> 00:24:58,599
Take the money. Take the money.

507
00:25:01,400 --> 00:25:02,559
Come on, come on.

508
00:25:02,559 --> 00:25:03,400
Keep drinking, keep drinking.

509
00:25:03,680 --> 00:25:04,599
There's plenty...

510
00:25:04,920 --> 00:25:05,559
of booze.

511
00:25:05,720 --> 00:25:06,880
And plenty of cash, too.

512
00:25:07,799 --> 00:25:09,440
Let's see how much you can drink.

513
00:25:18,640 --> 00:25:19,519
Come on, drink up.

514
00:25:19,519 --> 00:25:20,160
Come, sit down and drink.

515
00:25:20,160 --> 00:25:20,640
Sit down and drink.

516
00:25:20,640 --> 00:25:21,640
Come on, come on.

517
00:25:21,680 --> 00:25:22,279
Easy, take it easy.

518
00:25:22,799 --> 00:25:23,519
No rush.

519
00:25:24,640 --> 00:25:26,640
There's... there's plenty of cash.

520
00:25:26,799 --> 00:25:27,240
And booze...

521
00:25:28,240 --> 00:25:28,720
What's wrong?

522
00:25:29,240 --> 00:25:30,559
Touching costs extra.

523
00:25:31,119 --> 00:25:32,000
How much extra?

524
00:25:32,400 --> 00:25:33,359
10,000 for a touch.

525
00:25:34,519 --> 00:25:35,720
What... What about a kiss?

526
00:25:35,720 --> 00:25:36,359
20,000.

527
00:25:40,720 --> 00:25:41,680
Alright, alright, alright.

528
00:25:42,039 --> 00:25:42,519
Come here, come on.

529
00:25:42,519 --> 00:25:42,880
I'll give you...

530
00:25:42,920 --> 00:25:43,759
I'll add more for you.

531
00:25:46,240 --> 00:25:46,920
Come here, let me kiss you.

532
00:25:47,039 --> 00:25:47,519
Come here.

533
00:25:51,599 --> 00:25:52,759
You old bastard.

534
00:25:55,759 --> 00:25:56,640
With all your rotten deeds...

535
00:25:59,680 --> 00:26:00,400
I really want to...

536
00:26:01,079 --> 00:26:01,839
beat you to death.

537
00:26:01,880 --> 00:26:02,559
Don't, don't, don't.

538
00:26:02,680 --> 00:26:03,240
Calm down.

539
00:26:03,279 --> 00:26:04,839
I... I forgot about that.

540
00:26:05,039 --> 00:26:06,039
You used to chase this slut,

541
00:26:06,119 --> 00:26:06,559
didn't you?

542
00:26:06,799 --> 00:26:08,759
Any real man loved how slutty she was.

543
00:26:09,039 --> 00:26:10,079
I'm not kidding you.

544
00:26:10,079 --> 00:26:11,880
If I hadn't been in a rush for a meeting that day,

545
00:26:11,880 --> 00:26:13,160
I would've had my way with her.

546
00:26:13,759 --> 00:26:14,599
You bastard!

547
00:26:15,440 --> 00:26:16,039
Security!

548
00:26:16,799 --> 00:26:17,359
Cheng Youtian,

549
00:26:17,519 --> 00:26:19,240
you wanna get rough with me over that slut,

550
00:26:19,240 --> 00:26:19,759
is that it?

551
00:26:22,400 --> 00:26:25,079
Look at your frail, mushy body.

552
00:26:25,359 --> 00:26:26,039
You think you can take me on?

553
00:26:26,039 --> 00:26:26,640
Director Ma!

554
00:26:27,240 --> 00:26:27,839
Director Ma!

555
00:26:28,839 --> 00:26:30,400
Go back the way you came, nice and quiet.

556
00:26:30,440 --> 00:26:31,119
Did you hear me?

557
00:26:31,440 --> 00:26:32,599
Before security kicks...

558
00:26:32,599 --> 00:26:33,559
kicks you the hell out!

559
00:26:33,599 --> 00:26:34,200
Did you hear me?

560
00:26:34,359 --> 00:26:35,039
Get the fuck out!

561
00:26:35,400 --> 00:26:35,839
Get lost!

562
00:26:56,519 --> 00:26:56,960
It's getting cold.

563
00:26:56,960 --> 00:26:57,880
Don't catch a cold.

564
00:26:58,640 --> 00:26:59,240
Alright, alright.

565
00:27:01,240 --> 00:27:01,960
Oh, jeez!

566
00:27:13,880 --> 00:27:15,359
You little vixen.

567
00:27:21,759 --> 00:27:22,680
Alright, alright, alright.

568
00:27:29,279 --> 00:27:29,920
Slow down, slow down.

569
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:30,599
No rush.

570
00:27:30,640 --> 00:27:31,319
Take your time.

571
00:27:31,359 --> 00:27:31,920
No need to rush.

572
00:27:32,680 --> 00:27:33,880
There's plenty of money.

573
00:27:33,880 --> 00:27:35,160
Plenty of booze, too.

574
00:27:35,319 --> 00:27:36,039
If you're happy,

575
00:27:36,039 --> 00:27:36,920
I'm happy.

576
00:27:40,240 --> 00:27:41,119
Come on, come on.

577
00:27:41,319 --> 00:27:43,319
Slowly, slowly, nice and slow.

578
00:27:49,960 --> 00:27:51,279
Got quite some strength, huh?

579
00:28:19,240 --> 00:28:19,799
Holy crap!

580
00:28:19,799 --> 00:28:20,279
All gone.

581
00:28:21,440 --> 00:28:22,160
No more money.

582
00:28:23,559 --> 00:28:24,359
I can still drink!

583
00:28:24,759 --> 00:28:25,720
We do! Plenty of it!

584
00:28:25,720 --> 00:28:26,079
Come on, come on.

585
00:28:26,079 --> 00:28:26,400
Money!

586
00:28:26,519 --> 00:28:27,000
Let's head this way.

587
00:28:27,000 --> 00:28:27,400
Come on.

588
00:28:27,440 --> 00:28:28,559
Plenty of money, plenty of booze!

589
00:28:28,599 --> 00:28:28,960
Come on, come on.

590
00:28:29,039 --> 00:28:29,720
This way, this way.

591
00:28:29,960 --> 00:28:30,400
Take the money.

592
00:28:30,400 --> 00:28:30,960
Come on, come on.

593
00:28:31,079 --> 00:28:31,559
Easy, easy, easy.

594
00:28:31,559 --> 00:28:32,200
Take it easy, slow down.

595
00:28:32,200 --> 00:28:32,759
Easy, easy.

596
00:28:32,759 --> 00:28:33,440
Steady now. Still got cash?

597
00:28:33,519 --> 00:28:34,279
Yeah, yeah, I do.

598
00:28:34,319 --> 00:28:34,720
Come on, come on.

599
00:28:34,759 --> 00:28:36,359
Sit down, have a seat.

600
00:28:38,039 --> 00:28:39,119
Got plenty of cash!

601
00:28:39,400 --> 00:28:40,119
Come on.

602
00:28:45,160 --> 00:28:45,599
Direct—

603
00:28:46,440 --> 00:28:47,200
Director!

604
00:28:47,799 --> 00:28:48,680
What the hell is it?

605
00:28:49,880 --> 00:28:51,119
The auction has started.

606
00:28:51,119 --> 00:28:51,920
Everyone's here?

607
00:28:52,759 --> 00:28:53,559
Everyone's arrived.

608
00:28:53,759 --> 00:28:54,640
Just waiting on you.

609
00:28:57,440 --> 00:28:57,960
Xuemei.

610
00:28:58,519 --> 00:29:00,400
Drink... drink some water.

611
00:29:00,839 --> 00:29:01,240
Have some water.

612
00:29:01,400 --> 00:29:01,880
Sober up a bit.

613
00:29:02,519 --> 00:29:03,720
I... I'll go to the meeting.

614
00:29:03,880 --> 00:29:04,839
I'll be back as soon as it's over.

615
00:29:04,880 --> 00:29:05,319
All right?

616
00:29:05,599 --> 00:29:06,279
Wait for me, okay?

617
00:29:07,519 --> 00:29:08,400
Holy crap...

618
00:29:11,880 --> 00:29:13,200
Terrible timing.

619
00:29:15,680 --> 00:29:16,400
Hey...

620
00:29:17,079 --> 00:29:17,720
Drink some water.

621
00:29:18,119 --> 00:29:18,559
Sober up, okay?

622
00:29:18,880 --> 00:29:20,079
I'll be right back.

623
00:29:25,640 --> 00:29:26,559
Quite something, huh?

624
00:31:52,799 --> 00:31:54,519
Even drunk, you still knew to grab the money, huh?

625
00:34:32,559 --> 00:34:33,760
Tieping.

626
00:34:36,320 --> 00:34:38,360
Why are you so foolish?

627
00:34:39,039 --> 00:34:40,400
Tieping.

628
00:36:16,679 --> 00:36:18,559
I know Master's been doing everything to protect me,

629
00:36:19,400 --> 00:36:20,599
but I can't let her go.

630
00:36:20,840 --> 00:36:22,119
She took Sister Xuemei's money.

631
00:36:22,440 --> 00:36:23,159
She's not a good person.

632
00:36:23,159 --> 00:36:23,599
Don't.

633
00:36:23,800 --> 00:36:25,559
Who's good and who's bad—

634
00:36:25,840 --> 00:36:27,840
what's that got to do with you?

635
00:36:29,559 --> 00:36:31,559
You can't go hurting people!

636
00:36:31,559 --> 00:36:33,599
What does this have to do with you?

637
00:36:35,519 --> 00:36:36,119
Tieping.

638
00:36:36,719 --> 00:36:37,360
Listen to me.

639
00:36:39,000 --> 00:36:39,840
I'm the one who killed them.

640
00:36:40,320 --> 00:36:41,159
I dumped the bodies.

641
00:36:42,079 --> 00:36:44,159
Up till now, you've only done one bad thing.

642
00:36:46,679 --> 00:36:47,960
You don't deserve to die for it.

643
00:36:49,239 --> 00:36:50,079
Do you hear me?

644
00:36:50,920 --> 00:36:51,920
Do you understand?

645
00:36:52,920 --> 00:36:54,599
We still have a long life ahead.

646
00:36:56,840 --> 00:36:57,360
Master.

647
00:37:00,360 --> 00:37:01,559
I killed them.

648
00:37:01,920 --> 00:37:02,920
I dumped the bodies.

649
00:37:03,360 --> 00:37:05,159
I'll take the fall for my own crimes.

650
00:37:05,280 --> 00:37:06,559
Tieping!

651
00:37:08,119 --> 00:37:09,039
Tieping!

652
00:37:14,639 --> 00:37:15,519
Shen Leshui.

653
00:37:16,159 --> 00:37:16,960
Liu Xiaosheng.

654
00:37:17,760 --> 00:37:18,920
Both of you bear witness for me.

655
00:37:19,800 --> 00:37:21,239
I killed Ma Guowen.

656
00:37:22,119 --> 00:37:23,039
I killed Ma Guowen...

657
00:37:23,039 --> 00:37:24,920
...because he dragged Sister Xuemei's name through the mud.

658
00:37:26,159 --> 00:37:27,840
I killed Qian Yichuan too.

659
00:37:28,960 --> 00:37:30,960
I killed him because of that foul mouth of his.

660
00:37:31,280 --> 00:37:32,360
The day Ma Guowen was killed,

661
00:37:32,679 --> 00:37:33,760
he was in the old plant area too.

662
00:37:33,880 --> 00:37:34,960
He saw me commit the murder,

663
00:37:35,320 --> 00:37:37,079
and used it to blackmail my master.

664
00:37:37,800 --> 00:37:38,800
If I hadn't killed him,

665
00:37:39,199 --> 00:37:40,280
none of us would've ever had peace.

666
00:37:40,400 --> 00:37:41,559
Tieping!

667
00:37:42,199 --> 00:37:44,119
It was me he saw!

668
00:37:46,119 --> 00:37:48,440
The clothes and snow boots I wore during the murder

669
00:37:48,920 --> 00:37:50,960
are right in the old plant's basement.

670
00:37:51,519 --> 00:37:52,880
Take the police there to get them,

671
00:37:53,199 --> 00:37:54,920
and you'll see I'm telling the truth.

672
00:37:55,079 --> 00:37:56,920
Tieping, don't talk nonsense!

673
00:37:58,639 --> 00:38:00,360
I dumped Ma Guowen's body!

674
00:38:01,039 --> 00:38:02,440
I put it on the train tracks!

675
00:38:02,679 --> 00:38:03,960
I'm guilty! I'm guilty!

676
00:38:03,960 --> 00:38:04,440
Master...

677
00:38:04,639 --> 00:38:05,639
Tieping made a mistake,

678
00:38:06,519 --> 00:38:08,519
and I covered for him!

679
00:38:08,639 --> 00:38:09,199
No!

680
00:38:10,039 --> 00:38:11,119
I was wrong.

681
00:38:11,119 --> 00:38:12,199
It's all my fault.

682
00:38:12,639 --> 00:38:13,519
Tieping.

683
00:38:15,840 --> 00:38:16,360
Tieping.

684
00:38:17,159 --> 00:38:17,760
Tieping...

685
00:38:20,119 --> 00:38:21,039
Come back with me.

686
00:38:21,039 --> 00:38:22,199
Let's turn ourselves in.

687
00:38:22,599 --> 00:38:23,280
Master...

688
00:38:24,400 --> 00:38:25,519
It's too late.

689
00:38:33,559 --> 00:38:36,679
I never should've gone looking for Ma Guowen!

690
00:38:38,960 --> 00:38:40,239
The moment I saw he was dead,

691
00:38:40,239 --> 00:38:42,000
I knew what happened.

692
00:38:42,880 --> 00:38:45,119
I kept shielding you, kept protecting you...

693
00:38:45,440 --> 00:38:46,559
I was just terrified something would happen to you.

694
00:38:46,679 --> 00:38:48,840
Terrified you'd get hurt!

695
00:38:51,760 --> 00:38:53,159
I was a fool! Such a fool!

696
00:38:53,159 --> 00:38:54,559
I was a fool, Master!

697
00:38:56,239 --> 00:38:56,840
Master...

698
00:38:57,599 --> 00:38:58,320
Don't cry.

699
00:38:59,199 --> 00:39:00,119
I killed people.

700
00:39:00,320 --> 00:39:01,199
I committed crimes.

701
00:39:01,440 --> 00:39:02,000
I own up to it.

702
00:39:05,840 --> 00:39:06,800
Shen Leshui.

703
00:39:07,039 --> 00:39:08,320
You say you didn't take that money.

704
00:39:08,599 --> 00:39:09,880
Then go uncover the truth.

705
00:39:09,960 --> 00:39:12,239
I'll definitely track down where that money went,

706
00:39:13,000 --> 00:39:14,519
and bring justice to Liu Xuemei.

707
00:39:16,119 --> 00:39:16,840
Xiaosheng.

708
00:39:20,039 --> 00:39:21,320
You have to believe this:

709
00:39:22,360 --> 00:39:23,400
your mother was a good person.

710
00:39:23,639 --> 00:39:24,280
I believe it.

711
00:39:25,440 --> 00:39:26,000
I believe you.

712
00:39:43,840 --> 00:39:44,719
Tieping.

713
00:39:45,679 --> 00:39:46,679
You're right.

714
00:39:48,679 --> 00:39:49,400
We have to accept it.

715
00:39:51,639 --> 00:39:52,159
Come on.

716
00:40:09,000 --> 00:40:10,039
Put your hands up!

717
00:40:26,599 --> 00:40:26,960
Cuff him!

718
00:40:26,960 --> 00:40:27,760
Freeze! Don't move!

719
00:40:29,840 --> 00:40:30,320
Don't move!

720
00:40:30,800 --> 00:40:31,280
Stay down!

721
00:41:44,119 --> 00:41:45,119
Sister Xuemei,

722
00:41:46,320 --> 00:41:47,280
I promise you,

723
00:41:48,880 --> 00:41:50,639
I'll find out where this money went

724
00:41:51,639 --> 00:41:52,840
and clear your name.

725
00:42:06,519 --> 00:42:07,719
Your old classmate said

726
00:42:08,280 --> 00:42:10,199
she has to track down this money,

727
00:42:10,360 --> 00:42:11,840
or she won't leave Lacheng.

728
00:42:12,000 --> 00:42:12,599
Where's your bag?

729
00:42:12,920 --> 00:42:13,880
Where's the bag? Don't touch me!

730
00:42:14,039 --> 00:42:14,639
Where's the bag?

731
00:42:15,360 --> 00:42:16,280
Where did you hide the money?

732
00:42:16,440 --> 00:42:17,639
When you picked up that bag,

733
00:42:17,639 --> 00:42:18,760
was the bag empty?

734
00:42:20,079 --> 00:42:21,840
If there was anything in it, would they toss it?

735
00:42:22,079 --> 00:42:23,599
You took Liu Xuemei's money.
